<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 4.426 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 4.426 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 4.426 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday through five auctions to purchase paper, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>	 AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>	700 million  16 days</p>
<p>	900 million   9 days</p>
<p>	  1.500 bln   3 days</p>
<p>	900 million   2 days</p>
<p>	426 million   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
